"decode_before_model","observed_provider_savings":null,"scenario":"three_turn_history_retry","signed_difference":0,"signed_local_reduction":0.0,"variant":"reference_original"},{"baseline_tokens":97096,"candidate_tokens":98064,"delivery":"direct_encoded_delivery","observed_provider_savings":null,"scenario":"three_turn_history_retry","signed_difference":-968,"signed_local_reduction":-0.00996951470709401,"variant":"reference_original"}],"execution_authority":false,"full_task_satisfaction":false,"global_durable_budget":false,"measured_decision":"Retain token-aware reference packing as an experimental representation. Its hypothetical direct-model cost and exact data restoration are measured locally; decode-before-model preserves the full original input cost. Actual worker delivery and task behavior remain unmeasured.","native_full_supervisor_invoked":false,"neural_candidate_promoted":false,"next_work":[{"acceptance":["Decoding before model input saves zero input tokens in this controlled experiment.","Do not label hypothetical packed-wire BPE reductions as observed provider savings.","No real worker/provider receipts are fabricated from pure codecs or scripted ledgers."],"id":"generic-admitted-worker-context-delivery","implementation":["Add a distinctly versioned generic complete-context worker interface; existing Bottle-specific adapters do not accept this profile.","Use a per-task expanded-context fallback when the complete packed-message cost rises; charge any routing labels or selection guidance.","Capture bytes actually passed to the model after router/worker materialization using the original native admission and resource leases.","Check the budget against the complete delivered packet and message framing; original-context reservations do not qualify a changed model payload.","Evaluate direct symbolic-reference interpretation against expanded context; exact Python decoding does not establish model interpretation equivalence.","Require exact head, codec/profile/tokenizer pins and required-source/instruction checks before and after use."],"priority":1},{"acceptance":["Maintain task behavior and charge all cumulative work before enabling compression by default.","Report per-task regressions and uncertainty; current headless direct-model case may cost more despite aggregate reduction."],"id":"paired-terminal-bench-outcomes-and-total-cost","implementation":["Run frozen paired task/model/config populations through the official verifier.","Capture actual provider input/output usage, indexing/training/setup work, full histories, retries and tool expansion reads.","Preserve failed attempt work and resource admission across restart; zero failed usage is never inferred."],"priority":2},{"acceptance":["All present task instructions remain unresolved; exact packing confers no task-completion authority."],"id":"intent-coverage-and-current-codebase-matching","implementation":["Decode complete instruction goals, guards, prohibitions, effects and numeric limits with source-span-accounted residuals.","Join intent atoms to current AST, interfaces, effects, graph, vectors and contracts in DuckDB/DuckLake.","Exercise the actual planner coverage API with negative omission controls before any relevance-based source reduction.","Keep unsupported requirements and raw source obligations mandatory; learned scores cannot discharge them."],"priority":3},{"acceptance":["Byte-exact reconstruction is data integrity, not CPython runtime equivalence.","Finite training improvement, fragment theorems, whole-task satisfaction and optimizer convergence remain distinct."],"id":"source-to-model-and-proof-index","implementation":["Retain richer learned CodebaseIR features as advisory; previous training-only SVD beat neural reconstruction.","Add constrained discrete decoding with exact bindings, literals, types, effects and control flow; unsupported atoms remain explicit.","Compile supported projections through genuine logic-family/checker routes and Lean.","Bind conditional proof-cache entries and reverse dependencies to exact source/head/target/checker artifacts."],"priority":4}],"official_terminal_bench_harness_executed":false,"proof_authority":false,"provider_token_savings_measured":false,"schema":"terminal-codebase-intent-ir-improvement-plan@6","source_model_equivalence_proved":false,"source_runtime_equivalence_proved":false}